Resubmitting request ;w; 

Hello,I am so grateful to catch your skeb opening . Your attention to detail steals my breath away every time. Lian'er is the illegitimate daughter to a high ranking court official and high class courtesan. She was raised as a 艺妓 and is considered the best in her province. She excels in all of the four arts (guqin, Go, calligraphy, painting) and is an excellent dancer. Feel free to depict her in whatever outfit/accessories you think is best. Lotus/ water lily motifs would be amazing

